  "idea": "Offboarding SOP that transitions departing clients with grace and security",
  "text": "Never leave company credentials active inside a past client's ad accounts. Months after retainers terminate, past contractors still hold admin permissions to client billing profiles and ad dashboards. Lingering account access exposes your agency to legal liability if unauthorized ad spend occurs later. Use an automated 1Password offboarding workflow in ClickUp to revoke all client permissions within sixty minutes. You eliminate compliance liabilities and safeguard your reputation.",
